import Mathlib.CategoryTheory.MorphismProperty.Retract

/-!
# Stability under retracts

The typeclass `MorphismProperty.IsStableUnderRetracts` and the fact that the classes of
monomorphisms, epimorphisms and isomorphisms are stable under retracts, originally developed here,
have since been upstreamed to Mathlib (`Mathlib.CategoryTheory.MorphismProperty.Retract`). This
module is retained as a placeholder that re-exports that development.
-/
